  - **spec:** `07-run-history.spec.md`
- [x] Streaming task output to clients
  - [x] SSE `status` / `output` / `done` + EventSource query auth + tenant stream ACL — #4 + fix PR #13 (`24-fix-task-streaming-progress`)
