  - [x] Use `Agent.resume` where cross-process continuation fits (base path)
  - [ ] Real `repo-hygiene-check` (not placeholder) + `SCHEDULED_REVIEW_JOBS` enable gate — **fix PR #14 closed; not on develop** (`25-fix-scheduled-review-jobs`, branch `fix/25-scheduled-review-jobs`)
  - **spec:** `09-scheduled-review-jobs.spec.md`
- [x] Event gateway
